=== THRESHOLD RECOMMENDATION (SYNTHETIC DATA ONLY) ===
RECOMMENDED_PHASH_HAMMING_THRESHOLD: 10
  Label: ASSUMPTION - measured on synthetic data only; unverified on real-world photo archives.
  Rationale: At threshold <= 10, pHash achieves 97.5%+ detection rate across crops, recompressions,
  and resizes while maintaining 0.00% false matches on unrelated synthetic pairs.
RECOMMENDED_DHASH_HAMMING_THRESHOLD: 8
  Label: ASSUMPTION - measured on synthetic data only; unverified on real-world photo archives.
